## Architecture Overview

```
Existing UI (unchanged)
       ↓
TripContext (modified to load/save via Supabase)
       ↓
src/lib/supabase.ts (new — Supabase client)
       ↓
Supabase PostgreSQL
```

**Key design decision:** Rather than creating custom hooks for every entity, I will modify the **existing `TripContext`** to:
1. Load trips (with stops, activities, expenses) from Supabase on mount
2. Make `addTrip`, `updateTrip`, `deleteTrip` persist to Supabase
3. Keep the same `Trip` interface consumed by all UI components

This minimizes file changes and avoids touching any UI component.

