## Database Schema

### Tables

| Table | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `trips` | Trip metadata (name, dates, budget, cover image) |
| `trip_stops` | City stops with order_index |
| `activities` | Per-stop, per-day activities with time/cost |
| `expenses` | Trip expenses by category |

No `profiles` table for MVP (auth deprioritized).

### Relationships

```
trips (1) → (N) trip_stops
trips (1) → (N) expenses
trip_stops (1) → (N) activities
```

### Key columns

- `activities.trip_stop_id` + `activities.date` → correct day association
- `trip_stops.order_index` → route ordering
- All tables use `uuid` primary keys via `gen_random_uuid()`

